FreeBSD port of the open-source Grok Build CLI (terminal AI coding agent).

This is a CloudBSD / RevyTech work-in-progress package of the public
harness: a fullscreen TUI that edits files, runs shell commands, and
manages long-running tasks. It is not an official xAI or FreeBSD package.

Sandbox isolation on FreeBSD uses a jail backend (helper still landing);
Landlock/Seatbelt (nono) is Linux/macOS only. Install textproc/ripgrep
for the system rg binary.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/grok-build
